From c0c0d4a3e916352e4bbdbb07b2d01ad2a0f4e71d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <agent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 03:54:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix chart zoom, resize, and oversized candle rendering

- Re-resolve canvas from DOM on each render to avoid stale references after Blazor re-renders
- Add ResizeObserver so the chart redraws when the container size changes
- Default to 80 visible bars instead of all candles to prevent giant blocks
- Cap maximum candle body width and lower minimum zoom bar count
- Use flat global JS functions for reliable MAUI Blazor WebView interop
- Let canvas fill chart container via CSS instead of fixed width/height attributes
